<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Hicom six mth net up 135 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Hicom six mth net up 135 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to Sept 30, 1996</p>
<p>			(in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	     282.68	  vs     120.15</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)     27.40	  vs	11.60</p>
<p>    Turnover	     2,906.26	  vs     1,487.98</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	 407.92	  vs	 180.09</p>
<p>    Minorities (less)     11.95	  vs (less)  7.61</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	 34.00	  vs	  nil</p>
<p>    Dividend  (cents)	4.00	  vs	  nil</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name is Hicom Holdings Bhd. It is in the</p>
<p>automotive and cement manufacturing businesses, as well as</p>
<p>construction.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
</text>
